          %p We now discuss one more extra property on monoidal categories
          #DualizableObject.num_defn
            %h6#definition_11 Definition
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
