                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                      %mn 2
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{Z} \stackrel{mod\, 2}{\longrightarrow}\mathbb{Z}/2
            %p
              This means that for
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
