            )
          %p
            We outline key steps of the proof of theorem
            = succeed "," do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TheTheorem"}
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#Deligne02"} Deligne 02
          %ol
            %li
              %p
                %strong
                  Proposition
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LengthOfObjectIsBounded"}
                states that in a
                = succeed "-" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi k
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} k
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+category"} tensor category
                an object
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi X
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
                is of subexponential growth (def.
