                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/permutation"} permutation
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action"} action
                on
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+powers"} tensor powers
                appears, from just a kind of finite-dimensionality assumption.
            %li
              %p
                %strong
                  Proposition
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#SchurFinitenessImpliesExistenceOfSuperFiberFunctor"}
                in turn says that if every object in
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi 𝒜
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{A}
                is annihilated by some
